    ...  History of changes
    ...  ******************
    ...  - 23.02.2022 - https://jira3.ext.net.nokia.com/browse/TAT-22569 - Initial creation
    ...  - 03.10.2023 - TAT-24917 - Hran_frame resource name change to ca_pm_logs_frame due to migration to robotws
    ...
